[TITLE]
FILLED_CIRCULAR drift with control rules that read link velocity: C reads the velocity through link_getVelocity(), which edits the link's geometry by one bit
FILLED_CIRCULAR drift test: conduits whose full depth changes by one bit after EPA's add/subtract round trip

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS CFS
FLOW_ROUTING DYNWAVE
START_DATE 01/01/2020
START_TIME 00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE 01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME 00:00:00
END_DATE 01/01/2020
END_TIME 06:00:00
REPORT_STEP 00:05:00
WET_STEP 00:05:00
DRY_STEP 00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP 5
INERTIAL_DAMPING PARTIAL
NORMAL_FLOW_LIMITED BOTH

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name Elev MaxDepth InitDepth SurDepth Aponded
J0 100.00 10 0 0 0
J1 99.50 10 0 0 0
J2 99.00 10 0 0 0
J3 98.50 10 0 0 0
J4 98.00 10 0 0 0
J5 97.50 10 0 0 0
J6 97.00 10 0 0 0
J7 96.50 10 0 0 0

[OUTFALLS]
OUT2 90.0 FREE NO
OUT 96.00 FREE NO

[CONDUITS]
;;Name From To Length Roughness InOffset OutOffset InitFlow MaxFlow
C0 J0 J1 200 0.013 0 0 0 0
C1 J1 J2 200 0.013 0 0 0 0
C2 J2 J3 200 0.013 0 0 0 0
C3 J3 J4 200 0.013 0 0 0 0
C4 J4 J5 200 0.013 0 0 0 0
C5 J5 J6 200 0.013 0 0 0 0
C6 J6 J7 200 0.013 0 0 0 0
C7 J7 OUT 200 0.013 0 0 0 0

[ORIFICES]
;;Name From To Type Offset Qcoeff Gated CloseTime
O1 J7 OUT2 SIDE 0 0.65 NO 0

[XSECTIONS]
;;Link Shape Geom1 Geom2 Geom3 Geom4 Barrels
C0 FILLED_CIRCULAR 0.68 0.18 0 0 1
C1 FILLED_CIRCULAR 0.91 0.41 0 0 1
C2 FILLED_CIRCULAR 0.92 0.42 0 0 1
C3 FILLED_CIRCULAR 0.93 0.43 0 0 1
C4 FILLED_CIRCULAR 1.36 0.36 0 0 1
C5 FILLED_CIRCULAR 1.57 0.57 0 0 1
C6 FILLED_CIRCULAR 1.59 0.59 0 0 1
C7 FILLED_CIRCULAR 1.61 0.61 0 0 1

O1 CIRCULAR 0.5 0 0 0

[CONTROLS]
RULE R0
IF LINK C0 VELOCITY > 0.8
THEN ORIFICE O1 SETTING = 0.5
ELSE ORIFICE O1 SETTING = 1
PRIORITY 1

RULE R1
IF LINK C1 VELOCITY > 0.8
THEN ORIFICE O1 SETTING = 0.5
ELSE ORIFICE O1 SETTING = 1
PRIORITY 2

RULE R2
IF LINK C2 VELOCITY > 0.8
THEN ORIFICE O1 SETTING = 0.5
ELSE ORIFICE O1 SETTING = 1
PRIORITY 3

RULE R3
IF LINK C3 VELOCITY > 0.8
THEN ORIFICE O1 SETTING = 0.5
ELSE ORIFICE O1 SETTING = 1
PRIORITY 4

RULE R4
IF LINK C4 VELOCITY > 0.8
THEN ORIFICE O1 SETTING = 0.5
ELSE ORIFICE O1 SETTING = 1
PRIORITY 5

RULE R5
IF LINK C5 VELOCITY > 0.8
THEN ORIFICE O1 SETTING = 0.5
ELSE ORIFICE O1 SETTING = 1
PRIORITY 6

RULE R6
IF LINK C6 VELOCITY > 0.8
THEN ORIFICE O1 SETTING = 0.5
ELSE ORIFICE O1 SETTING = 1
PRIORITY 7

RULE R7
IF LINK C7 VELOCITY > 0.8
THEN ORIFICE O1 SETTING = 0.5
ELSE ORIFICE O1 SETTING = 1
PRIORITY 8

[INFLOWS]
J0 FLOW HYD FLOW 1.0 1.0

[TIMESERIES]
HYD 01/01/2020 00:00 0
HYD 01/01/2020 01:00 1.5
HYD 01/01/2020 02:00 0.2
HYD 01/01/2020 06:00 0

[REPORT]
INPUT NO
CONTROLS NO
SUBCATCHMENTS ALL
NODES ALL
LINKS ALL

